{"id":"0c35f85ed8d7dce6","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-zfc-symmetric-difference-closed-class.md","title":"ZFC Symmetric Difference Closed Class","display":"df-zfc-symmetric-difference-closed-class — ZFC Symmetric Difference Closed Class","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-symmetric-difference-closed-class","aliases":["58-df-zfc-symmetric-difference-closed-class"],"display":"df-zfc-symmetric-difference-closed-class — ZFC Symmetric Difference Closed Class","depends_on":["[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-setop-symmetric-difference.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-class.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-symmetric-difference-closed-class"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-symmetric-difference-closed-class</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-symmetric-difference-closed-class — ZFC Symmetric Difference Closed Class"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3acb61572e0c31be\" href=\"?note=3acb61572e0c31be\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-zfc-setop-symmetric-difference.md\">../batch08/58-df-zfc-setop-symmetric-difference.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" href=\"?note=ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-class.md\">../batch11/58-df-class.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> is a class variable and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Class}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Class}_S\\)</span> is the definable-class predicate (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" href=\"?note=ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-class.md\">../batch11/58-df-class.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSetopSymmetricDifference}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSetopSymmetricDifference}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3acb61572e0c31be\" href=\"?note=3acb61572e0c31be\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-zfc-setop-symmetric-difference.md\">../batch08/58-df-zfc-setop-symmetric-difference.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SymmetricDifferenceClosedClass}_S\\subseteq\\mathsf{Cls}\">\\(\\mathrm{SymmetricDifferenceClosedClass}_S\\subseteq\\mathsf{Cls}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}symmetric\\text{-}difference\\text{-}closed\\text{-}class} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{SymmetricDifferenceClosedClass}_S(C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Class}_S(C)\\land\n\\forall x,y\\in C\\;\\exists d\\in C\\;\\mathrm{ZfcSetopSymmetricDifference}_S(d,x,y)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}symmetric\\text{-}difference\\text{-}closed\\text{-}class} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{SymmetricDifferenceClosedClass}_S(C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Class}_S(C)\\land\n\\forall x,y\\in C\\;\\exists d\\in C\\;\\mathrm{ZfcSetopSymmetricDifference}_S(d,x,y)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch08/58-df-zfc-setop-symmetric-difference.md","status":"resolved","id":"3acb61572e0c31be","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-setop-symmetric-difference.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-class.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca2a9c9166fa8cce","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-class.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-class.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca2a9c9166fa8cce","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$C$ is a class variable and $\\mathrm{Class}_S$ is the definable-class predicate (see [[../batch11/58-df-class.md]]).","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-zfc-setop-symmetric-difference.md","status":"resolved","id":"3acb61572e0c31be","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcSetopSymmetricDifference}_S\\subseteq V^3$ (see [[../batch08/58-df-zfc-setop-symmetric-difference.md]]).","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Class}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcSetopSymmetricDifference}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SymmetricDifferenceClosedClass}_S\\subseteq\\mathsf{Cls}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}symmetric\\text{-}difference\\text{-}closed\\text{-}class} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{SymmetricDifferenceClosedClass}_S(C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Class}_S(C)\\land\n\\forall x,y\\in C\\;\\exists d\\in C\\;\\mathrm{ZfcSetopSymmetricDifference}_S(d,x,y)","display":true}],"bytes":1117,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3507","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-symmetric-difference-closed-class.md|58-df-zfc-symmetric-difference-closed-class]]（batch14）"}],"outgoing":["3acb61572e0c31be","ca2a9c9166fa8cce"]}